WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.934
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:09.291 --> 00:00:12.660
SPEAKER: Since 2015, KubeCon
has brought people together

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.970
for meaningful
engagements and learnings.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:16.890
And Google Cloud has
been part of the journey

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.660
from the very beginning.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.820
Because of the
community, contributions,

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.330
and collaboration, Google
Kubernetes Engine was born.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:28.080
And now, while celebrating
GKE's fifth anniversary,

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.260
we look forward to continuing
to grow and build together

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.110
during KubeCon Virtual 2020.

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.270
We may not be there
in person, but we'll

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:39.510
be there, ready to connect,
share, and inspire.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:42.560
[MUSIC PLAYING]

